<title>CANADA: Jumbo sells stores to West Coast.</title>
<headline>Jumbo sells stores to West Coast.</headline>
<dateline>BURLINGTON, Ontario 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jumbo Entertainment Inc said on Tuesday that it signed a letter of intent to sell its 63 franchised stores across Canada to West Coast Entertainment Corp for C$9.5 million.</p>
<p>Jumbo said the deal is expected to close before the end of January 1997 and is subject to government, regulatory and shareholder approval.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100))</p>
</text>
